sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as ScheduleController
  participant Service as ScheduleService
  participant Repo as CalendarEventRepository

  User->>Web: Open learning calendar
  Web->>Api: GET /api/v1/me/calendar-events
  Api->>Service: listEvents(userId, range)
  Service->>Repo: Query owned and course-related events
  Repo-->>Service: Events
  Service-->>Api: CalendarEventResponse list
  Api-->>Web: 200 OK
  Web-->>User: Render calendar
